              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="a1eb-0258-504f-a2f2">Mark of Nurgle and Black Path Models from your army Gain a 6+ Feel no Pain Save, If they already have a 6+ Feel no Pain or better, Improve the Armor Save by +1.</characteristic>
