          <rules>
            <rule name="Oath of Vengence" id="ee9a-ad1b-55f8-76c8" hidden="false">
              <description>At the Start of each Turn Pick one Enemy Unit on the battle Field to be a Vengence Target
All Black Path and Undivided Units in your army Gain the Following Bonus when targeting the Vengence target fir this turn. 
&gt; Re-roll hit rolls of 1
&gt; If the Target is Imperial, Gain Sustained Hits 2 In close combat</description>
