            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="a1eb-0258-504f-a2f2">When this unit charges, it adds 3&quot; to its total distance charged. In addition, if the charge was successful, the targeted unit cannot fall back from combat until the following turn.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Thrill of the Fight" id="b3cc-28a1-f643-9d05" hidden="false" typeId="10e3-235b-fd89-87a6" typeName="Abillities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="a1eb-0258-504f-a2f2">If an enemy Model or unit has a higher Toughness Weapon Skill or Strength, increase this units WS by +1 and Strength by +1.</characteristic>
