          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="a1eb-0258-504f-a2f2">Limits: 1× per battle


Timing: Command phase (yours)


Condition: CULT DEMAGOGUE model inside


Result: (optional)


charge declaration allowed even after it Advanced


model attacks: Hit roll +1, Wound roll +1


