            <profile name="Malign Sacrifice" id="ae95-568e-d9be-283b" hidden="false" typeId="10e3-235b-fd89-87a6" typeName="Abillities">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="a1eb-0258-504f-a2f2">Timing: Fight phase start


Condition: ≥1 Dark Disciple model inside


Select: (optional) 1 such model + 1 enemy unit in Engagement Range of this unit; 1D6


Result:


2-5: 1 mortal wound on the enemy unit


6: D3 mortal wounds on it


whatever the roll (1 included), the chosen Dark Disciple model is then destroyed</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
